.TH DANBY-GRAVITYPENDULUM 1
.SH NAME
danby-gravitypendulum \- simulate gravity-gradient attitude motion
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B gravitypendulum
.SH DESCRIPTION
The display follows an extended body in a circular orbit.  Tidal gravity tends
to align its long axis with the local vertical.  Orbital rate controls the
restoring torque; damping removes libration energy.
.PP
The left diagram shows the body and local orbital tangent.  The live plot shows
attitude and angular speed.  Click a parameter scale to change it, space pauses,
period steps while paused, R resets, and Q exits.
